        "original_id": "4eeb1d17-91c1-5a18-b7e5-aad41eebd499",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: In Love and War (1987 film)\n- People: James Woods, Jane Alexander, James Stockdale, Sybil Stockdale, Steven Vincent Leigh\n- Roles: United States Navy vice admiral, aviator, prisoner of war\n- Events: Vietnam War\n\nFacts:\n- James Bond Stockdale was born on December 23, 1923.\n- James Stockdale was a United States Navy vice admiral and aviator.\n- During the Vietnam War, James Stockdale was held as an American prisoner of war for more than seven years and received the Medal of Honor.\n- In 1987, the television film In Love and War was released as a Vietnam War-based thriller/drama.\n- In Love and War starred James Woods and Jane Alexander.\n- In Love and War was based on the true story of James Stockdale and Sybil Stockdale.\n- In 1987, Steven Vincent Leigh appeared in In Love and War.\n- James Bond Stockdale died on July 5, 2005.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
